<Base title="Corrections policy"><div class="wrap"><article class="prose"><div class="eyebrow">Accountability</div><h1>Corrections &amp; updates.</h1><p>Accuracy matters. If you believe an article contains an error, <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> with the article URL, the disputed passage and a reliable source where possible.</p><p>We will review the report and update material errors with a clear correction note and an updated date. Routine typographical fixes may be made without a separate note. We cannot promise a specific response time.</p></article></div></Base>
